A picture set to "Not 3D" in the shared per-file store no longer gets a pair thumbnail: the image thumbnailer clears the
stereo mark its plain read carries (the edition's Qt reports a PNG's sTER chunk as the text Stereo3DLayout) on an image the
stereo layer did not make a pair, so the thumbnail worker no longer announces and caches it as one. A marked picture with no
kept choice is still a pair, and a kept swap or packing still applies (ORDER 581).
